{"type":"standard","title":"Carijona language","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Carijona language</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q3446655","titles":{"canonical":"Carijona_language","normalized":"Carijona language","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Carijona language</span></span>"},"pageid":35232414,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Carijona.png/330px-Carijona.png","width":330,"height":446},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/33/Carijona.png","width":443,"height":599},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1326859406","tid":"4de1b5b9-d66a-11f0-ad0d-cefea934dcdd","timestamp":"2025-12-11T08:20:51Z","description":"Endangered Cariban language spoken in Colombia","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carijona_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carijona_language?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carijona_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Carijona_language"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carijona_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Carijona_language","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carijona_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Carijona_language"}},"extract":"Carijona (Karihona) is a moribund Cariban language, or a pair of languages, of Colombia. It is spoken by only 15 people as of 2015. Derbyshire (1999) lists the varieties Hianacoto-Umaua and Carijona proper as separate languages.","extract_html":"<p><b>Carijona</b> (Karihona) is a moribund Cariban language, or a pair of languages, of Colombia. It is spoken by only 15 people as of 2015. Derbyshire (1999) lists the varieties Hianacoto-Umaua and Carijona proper as separate languages.</p>"}